Homepage: https://github.com/WebLJ-si/Platno
Description: Local media library with a web player
 Platno scans your video folders, recognises movies and series, and plays
 them in a browser. Media files are never modified. Static program; FFmpeg
 converts videos that browsers cannot play directly.
